    "Keeps the raw optical (PPG) history frames of your WHOOP 5/MG on this Mac so SpO₂ can be reverse-engineered offline. Off by default; nothing is uploaded.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps the raw optical (PPG) history frames of your WHOOP 5/MG on this Mac so SpO₂ can be reverse-engineered offline. Off by default; nothing is uploaded."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Behält die optischen Roh-Verlaufsframes (PPG) deines WHOOP 5/MG auf diesem Mac, damit SpO₂ offline rekonstruiert werden kann. Standardmäßig aus; es wird nichts hochgeladen."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Сохраняет на этом Mac сырые оптические (PPG) кадры истории вашего WHOOP 5/MG, чтобы SpO₂ можно было расшифровать офлайн. По умолчанию выключено; ничего не загружается."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Makes your WHOOP 5.0/MG advertise its heart rate as a standard Bluetooth HR sensor, so a Garmin (Edge/watch), Zwift or gym equipment can use it during a workout. Applied on the next connection (and immediately if connected); writes the strap's whoop_live_hr_in_adv_ind_pkt flag, which is stored on the strap until you switch it back. Reversible. Needs the full encrypted bond.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Makes your WHOOP 5.0/MG advertise its heart rate as a standard Bluetooth HR sensor, so a Garmin (Edge/watch), Zwift or gym equipment can use it during a workout. Applied on the next connection (and immediately if connected); writes the strap's whoop_live_hr_in_adv_ind_pkt flag, which is stored on the strap until you switch it back. Reversible. Needs the full encrypted bond."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lässt deinen WHOOP 5.0/MG seine Herzfrequenz als Standard-Bluetooth-HF-Sensor senden, damit ein Garmin (Edge/Uhr), Zwift oder Fitnessgeräte ihn beim Training nutzen können. Wird bei der nächsten Verbindung angewendet (und sofort, wenn verbunden); schreibt das Flag whoop_live_hr_in_adv_ind_pkt des Straps, das auf dem Strap gespeichert bleibt, bis du es zurückschaltest. Umkehrbar. Benötigt die vollständige verschlüsselte Kopplung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Naps": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
