    "Needs the full encrypted bond to apply — close the official WHOOP app and pair the strap to NOOP first. Your choice is saved until then.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Needs the full encrypted bond to apply — close the official WHOOP app and pair the strap to NOOP first. Your choice is saved until then."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zum Anwenden ist die vollständige verschlüsselte Kopplung nötig – schließe die offizielle WHOOP-App und koppele den Strap zuerst mit NOOP. Deine Auswahl bleibt bis dahin gespeichert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needs the full encrypted bond — close the official WHOOP app and pair the strap to NOOP first (a live-HR-only link can't carry the unlock).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Needs the full encrypted bond — close the official WHOOP app and pair the strap to NOOP first (a live-HR-only link can't carry the unlock)."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Benötigt die vollständige verschlüsselte Kopplung – schließe die offizielle WHOOP-App und koppele den Strap zuerst mit NOOP (eine reine Live-HR-Verbindung kann die Freischaltung nicht übertragen)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No nights here yet. Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources to see every night, your sleep stages and trends straight away. Or wear your strap overnight. It syncs automatically and your first night shows up here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No nights here yet. Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources to see every night, your sleep stages and trends straight away. Or wear your strap overnight. It syncs automatically and your first night shows up here."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Noch keine Nächte hier. Importiere deinen WHOOP-Export unter Datenquellen, um sofort jede Nacht, deine Schlafphasen und Trends zu sehen. Oder trage deinen Strap über Nacht: Er synchronisiert automatisch und deine erste Nacht erscheint hier."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Пока нет данных о сне. Импортируйте данные WHOOP в разделе «Источники данных», чтобы сразу увидеть все ночи, стадии сна и тренды. Или наденьте браслет на ночь: он синхронизируется автоматически, и ваша первая ночь появится здесь."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not yet available from WHOOP 5.0 on this Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not yet available from WHOOP 5.0 on this Mac"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auf diesem Mac vom WHOOP 5.0 noch nicht verfügbar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Put the strap on first — the deep stream is on-wrist only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Put the strap on first — the deep stream is on-wrist only."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lege zuerst den Strap an – der Deep-Stream läuft nur am Handgelenk."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Record raw PPG for SpO₂ research": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record raw PPG for SpO₂ research"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rohdaten für SpO₂-Forschung aufzeichnen"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Записывать сырой PPG для исследования SpO₂"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wear the strap, tap once, then let it sync and share your strap log.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wear the strap, tap once, then let it sync and share your strap log."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trage den Strap, tippe einmal, lass ihn dann synchronisieren und teile dein Strap-Log."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "WHOOP 5/MG straps hand a fresh app only live heart rate. The official app switches on the deeper streams (high-rate HR + motion + history) by writing a set of feature flags — a sequence two independent projects have documented. With this on, the button below sends that exact sequence to your strap. Unlike everything else here it does write to the strap, but it's reversible (it only changes which data the strap chooses to emit) and is the same thing the official app does. The flags are stored on the strap until they're changed back. Experimental: it may do nothing on your firmware. Works on Mac and iPhone once the strap has the full encrypted bond and is on your wrist.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHOOP 5/MG straps hand a fresh app only live heart rate. The official app switches on the deeper streams (high-rate HR + motion + history) by writing a set of feature flags — a sequence two independent projects have documented. With this on, the button below sends that exact sequence to your strap. Unlike everything else here it does write to the strap, but it's reversible (it only changes which data the strap chooses to emit) and is the same thing the official app does. The flags are stored on the strap until they're changed back. Experimental: it may do nothing on your firmware. Works on Mac and iPhone once the strap has the full encrypted bond and is on your wrist."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "WHOOP-5/MG-Straps geben einer frischen App nur die Live-Herzfrequenz. Die offizielle App schaltet die tieferen Streams (hochfrequente HF + Bewegung + Verlauf) frei, indem sie eine Reihe von Feature-Flags schreibt – eine Abfolge, die zwei unabhängige Projekte dokumentiert haben. Ist dies aktiv, sendet die Schaltfläche unten genau diese Abfolge an deinen Strap. Anders als alles andere hier schreibt das tatsächlich auf den Strap, ist aber umkehrbar (es ändert nur, welche Daten der Strap sendet) und entspricht dem, was die offizielle App auch tut. Die Flags bleiben auf dem Strap gespeichert, bis sie zurückgesetzt werden. Experimentell: Auf deiner Firmware kann es wirkungslos sein. Funktioniert auf Mac und iPhone, sobald der Strap die vollständige verschlüsselte Kopplung hat und am Handgelenk sitzt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
